    "type": "game",
    "name": "Carrom Slam!",
    "steam_appid": 2417650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/d797478ece6340a52808ff042af7dc1d.poster.avif?t=1732032891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/d797478ece6340a52808ff042af7dc1d.webm?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/d797478ece6340a52808ff042af7dc1d.mp4?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic Indian game Carrom is now available to play online in Carrom Slam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrom is most similar to 8-ball billiards to those unfamiliar with the game. Players take turns shooting the striker from their baseline attempting to pocket coins the corners of the board. The red piece, or queen, must be pocketed and covered before the game ends, and is worth a high value of points. The round ends when one team sinks all of their pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/9ab2c5e746a330dc5d3bf45bb6ced23e.poster.avif?t=1732032891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/9ab2c5e746a330dc5d3bf45bb6ced23e.webm?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/9ab2c5e746a330dc5d3bf45bb6ced23e.mp4?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ player matches (steam friends and/or bots)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 game modes (professional, points, disc pool, blitz, sandbox, and training)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable rules, point values, board dimensions, and striker designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tutorial</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/d797478ece6340a52808ff042af7dc1d.poster.avif?t=1732032891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/d797478ece6340a52808ff042af7dc1d.webm?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/d797478ece6340a52808ff042af7dc1d.mp4?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic Indian game Carrom is now available to play online in Carrom Slam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrom is most similar to 8-ball billiards to those unfamiliar with the game. Players take turns shooting the striker from their baseline attempting to pocket coins the corners of the board. The red piece, or queen, must be pocketed and covered before the game ends, and is worth a high value of points. The round ends when one team sinks all of their pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/9ab2c5e746a330dc5d3bf45bb6ced23e.poster.avif?t=1732032891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/9ab2c5e746a330dc5d3bf45bb6ced23e.webm?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417650/extras/9ab2c5e746a330dc5d3bf45bb6ced23e.mp4?t=1732032891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ player matches (steam friends and/or bots)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 game modes (professional, points, disc pool, blitz, sandbox, and training)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable rules, point values, board dimensions, and striker designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive tutorial</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The classic tabletop game Carrom is brought to you in a true to life 3D simulation. Play the turn-based coin-flicker your way with customizable rules, boards, and strikers. All games modes available to play with 4+ friends, strangers, or variable difficulty bots.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Assamese, Bangla, Gujarati, Hindi, Kannada, Konkani, Malayalam, Marathi, Nepali, Odia, Punjabi (Shahmukhi), Sinhala, Tamil, Telugu, Urdu, French, Italian, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Afrikaans, Albanian, Amharic, Armenian, Azerbaijani, Basque, Belarusian, Bosnian, Catalan, Croatian, Estonian, Filipino, Galician, Georgian, Hausa, Icelandic, Igbo, Indonesian, Irish, Kazakh, Khmer, Kinyarwanda, Kyrgyz, Latvian, Lithuanian, Luxembourgish, Macedonian, Malay, Maltese, Maori, Mongolian, Persian, Punjabi (Gurmukhi), Scots, Serbian, Sindhi, Slovak, Slovenian, Sotho, Swahili, Tajik, Tatar, Turkmen, Uyghur, Uzbek, Welsh, Xhosa, Yoruba, Zulu",
